  "projectType": "saas",
  "projectName": "Pyren",
  "projectDescription": "A Linux desktop application that replicates HP's OMEN Gaming Hub, combining a privileged Rust daemon with an unprivileged Tauri + SvelteKit GUI to provide fan control, RGB lighting, power profiles, GPU overclocking, and system monitoring for HP OMEN and Victus laptops.",
