  "keyFeatures": [
    "Automatic power profile switching (Eco, Balanced, Performance, Unlimited) per power source",
    "Custom fan control modes: Auto, Max, Manual speed, and user-defined curves",
    "Keyboard RGB lighting with effects engine (breathing, spectrum, rainbowWave, wave, fade)",
    "GPU overclocking: core/memory offsets via NVML or nvidia-settings",
    "Patched hp-wmi kernel driver enabling fan speeds below the firmware's minimum floor",
    "Quick-access OSD widget (GTK layer-shell) for on-the-fly mode switching",
    "System monitor: CPU, GPU, RAM, disk, network, temperatures, top processes",
    "Graphics switching: Integrated, Hybrid, Discrete GPU modes",
    "External change detection: Fn+P, desktop power managers, other tools",
    "Privilege-separated architecture: root daemon + unprivileged desktop app via Unix socket IPC",
    "pyren-ctl CLI client for scripting and daemon control",
    "pyren-check standalone hardware compatibility checker"
  ],
